# Only what the build needs enters the context, so a docs or CI edit does not rebuild the image.
# Local settings, build output and tooling never enter it; the last matching line wins,
# so the local settings exclusions follow every re-admitted folder.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!rust-backend-template/
!migrations/
**/*.liquid
**/tests/
**/.env*
**/*.env
